					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1763632#post-2541710</guid>
				<title>Re: Mod Post - Open</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1763632/scp-5150-j#post-2541710</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 22 Jul 2016 06:21:13 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Professor P</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1927605</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>There are still people out there who have the condition and are genuinely offended by such jokes.</p> </blockquote> <p>I know and I have respect for them.</p> <blockquote> <p>Responding to their concerns with &quot;but some people abuse it!&quot; doesn't help anyone in the long run.</p> </blockquote> <p>I am not talking about people who are really offended, I'm talking about people who I know which aren't offended and are abusing this and I think it doesn't appear only where I live.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1763632#post-2541705</guid>
				<title>Re: Mod Post - Open</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1763632/scp-5150-j#post-2541705</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 22 Jul 2016 06:11:38 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Zyn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1404533</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>I think that people are sometimes abusing the fact that they have a disability by saying that they don't like the jokes you make around his/her disability, even if they aren't offended by these jokes</p> </blockquote> <p>There are still people out there who have the condition and are genuinely offended by such jokes. Responding to their concerns with &quot;but <em>some</em> people abuse it!&quot; doesn't help anyone in the long run.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1763632#post-2541694</guid>
				<title>Re: Mod Post - Open</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1763632/scp-5150-j#post-2541694</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 22 Jul 2016 05:46:45 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Professor P</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1927605</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I agree, but I didn't only refer to the opinions in this subforum I respect every opinion anyway and I take every comment seriously. It was indeed harsh to post such an accusation. However, I think that people are sometimes abusing the fact that they have a disability by saying that they don't like the jokes you make around his/her disability, even if they aren't offended by these jokes. I see a lot of people doing this in real life.</p> <p>I didn't mean to be like that.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
